e":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012305006:0":{"text":"……何も聞こえません。","source_cn":"……我什么都没有听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0A43C232AB1F7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012305007:0":{"text":"そんな……私たちの推測が間違っていたの？","source_cn":"怎么会……难道我们的推断出错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3337D031EBF10B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012305008:0":{"text":"いや、むしろ逆だよ！これは間違いなく風語りへの試練だ。","source_cn":"不，这恰恰证明了我们的推断没有错！这确实是对风语者的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB917D8EBBFCCEA42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012305009:2":{"text":"この世には音を完全に遮断できる壁なんてない。どんなに硬い岩でも、わずかな空気の共鳴が聞こえるはずなんだ。","source_cn":"这个世界上没有真正密不透风的墙。再坚实的岩壁，也会与空...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC623FED281EB96D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012305010:0":{"text":"でも、今は何も聞こえない、まったくね。つまり、これは本当の岩じゃないってことだ！","source_cn":"但这里完全没有声音，一点也没有。也就是说，这不是一块真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8A1CC326CD58F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012305011:0":{"text":"これは魔法で作られたバリアだよ。岩の裏に入口があるに違いない！","source_cn":"——而是用魔法营造的屏障，入口就藏在岩石后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41646FDC6B83B90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1012305011":{"text":"これは魔法で作られたバリアだよ。岩の裏に入口があるに違いない！","source_cn":"——而是用魔法营造的屏障，入口就藏在岩石后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41646FDC6B83B90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012305012:0":{"text":"私が思うに……","source_cn":"我有一个猜测。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74842F7F8E7D3AB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012305013:0":{"text":"岩の前にいる二種類の蝶は、バリアを破るヒントではないでしょうか。","source_cn":"岩壁前混杂着两种蝴蝶，这也许是在提示我们……破除屏障的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2ED549766831852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012305014:0":{"text":"片方は剣で、もう片方はライカの弓でしか打ち破れない。","source_cn":"一种蝴蝶，可以被剑术清除，另一种，则需要莱卡击破。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B47FB4934E44DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"